## 🔌 API 設計

### 認證端點

#### POST /api/v1/auth/register
```typescript
// 請求
{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "name": "John Doe"
}

// 回應 (201)
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "user_id": "uuid",
    "email": "user@example.com",
    "name": "John Doe"
  }
}
```

#### POST /api/v1/auth/login
```typescript
// 請求
{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}

// 回應 (200)
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "access_token": "eyJhbGc...",
    "refresh_token": "a1b2c3...",
    "expires_in": 900
  }
}
```

### 用戶端點

#### GET /api/v1/users
```typescript
// 查詢參數
?page=1&limit=20&sort=created_at&order=desc

// 回應 (200)
{
  "success": true,
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "email": "user@example.com",
      "name": "John Doe"
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 20,
    "total": 100
  }
}
```

